  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Fundamental Rights are essential rights guaranteed by the Constitution
    of India. They are contained mainly in Part III of the Constitution and protect
    important aspects of freedom, equality, dignity, and individual liberty. They
    also place constitutional limits on State action and provide legal protection
    when these rights are violated. Legislative.gov.in

    Fundamental Rights are
    commonly grouped into six main categories:

    Right to Equality ensures equality
    before the law and protects against discrimination on specified grounds such
    as religion, race, caste, sex, or place of birth. It also includes equality of
    opportunity in public employment and the abolition of untouchability. Legislative.gov.in

    Right
    to Freedom protects important liberties, including freedom of speech and expression,
    peaceful assembly, movement, and choice of profession. It also includes constitutional
    protections relating to life and personal liberty. Legislative.gov.in

    Right
    against Exploitation prohibits human trafficking and forced labour and protects
    children below fourteen from employment in factories, mines, and other hazardous
    work. Right to Freedom of Religion protects freedom of conscience and the freedom
    to profess, practise, and propagate religion, subject to constitutional provisions.
    Legislative.gov.in

    Cultural and Educational Rights help protect the language,
    script, and culture of communities and provide protections concerning educational
    institutions established and administered by religious and linguistic minorities.
    Legislative.gov.in

    Finally, the Right to Constitutional Remedies guarantees
    the right to approach the Supreme Court for enforcement of Fundamental Rights.
    This provides a constitutional mechanism for protecting these rights when they
    are violated.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ecf77945acdc26144b2f70e021c9fd31, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 6468205213134445944, guid: ecf77945acdc26144b2f70e021c9fd31, type: 2}
